{"product_id":"put-out-the-light","title":"Put Out The Light","description":"\u003cp\u003eIt's 1940 and war is underway. In Sheffield, England, a brother and sister set out to solve a mystery, brazenly believing that the air-raid signals are only false alarms. In Dachau, Germany, two boys come up with a bold plan to bring an end to the war and help a Polish prisoner escape. But when the bombs falling on Sheffield become a reality, and the German boys' plan hurls them unwittingly into the midst of the action, the children's adventures swiftly become a terrifying fight to survive.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Terry Deary\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408130544\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45795803693209,"sku":"17RA-39781408130544","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ef5de37a659_Put_Out_The_Light_Terry_Deary__1.jpg?v=1760541771","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/put-out-the-light","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}